t includes workflow.agenthelp.submitTurn. beginTurn degraded path and completeTurn persist identity are implemented in repl-invoke.ps1.\u0022,\u0022WorkspaceId\u0022:\u0022F:\\\\GitHub\\\\McpServer\u0022,\u0022Priority\u0022:\u0022high\u0022,\u0022Status\u0022:\u0022pending\u0022,\u0022Notes\u0022:null,\u0022AcceptanceCriteria\u0022:[{\u0022id\u0022:\u0022ac-1\u0022,\u0022text\u0022:\u0022plugins/core cache-scope keeps root session-state for UserPromptSubmit. ReplacePluginCache retains or rebinds. Resolve-McpCacheDir uses hook workspace path when env and profile cwd would fail. Get-ReplMethodTimeoutSeconds long list includes workflow.agenthelp.submitTurn. beginTurn degraded path and completeTurn persist identity are implemented in repl-invoke.ps1.\u0022,\u0022isSatisfied\u0022:false,\u0022evidence\u0022:null}],\u0022ScopeStartLayerKey\u0022:\u0022layer-1\u0022,\u0022ScopeEndLayerKey\u0022:null},{\u0022Id\u0022:\u0022TR-MCP-TRIAGEREQ-001\u0022,\u0022Title\u0022:\u0022ValidateTrId create only\u0022,\u0022Body\u0022:\u0022RequirementsWorkflow applies TrIdPattern only on create and batch create. getTr updateTr deleteTr accept any non-empty id and resolve the store, returning 404 if missing.\u0022,\u0022WorkspaceId\u0022:\u0022F:\\\\GitHub\\\\McpServer\u0022,\u0022Priority\u0022:\u0022high\u0022,\u0022Status\u0022:\u0022pending\u0022,\u0022Notes\u0022:null,\u0022AcceptanceCriteria\u0022:[{\u0022id\u0022:\u0022ac-1\u0022,\u0022text\u0022:\u0022RequirementsWorkflow applies TrIdPattern only on create and batch create. getTr updateTr deleteTr accept any non-empty id and resolve the store, returning 404 if missing.\u0022,\u0022isSatisfied\u0022:false,\u0022evidence\u0022:null}],\u0022ScopeStartLayerKey\u0022:\u0022layer-1\u0022,\u0022ScopeEndLayerKey\u0022:null},{\u0022Id\u0022:\u0022TR-MCP-TRIAGESCHEMA-001\u0022,\u0022Title\u0022:\u0022Startup probe for AgentSession header columns\u0022,\u0022Body\u0022:\u0022Startup schema probe requires SessionLogs AgentSessionId, AgentSes