r REPL parity, plugin recovery integration, artifact-only normalization refinement, and external-agent validation.","AcceptanceCriteria":[{"id":"ac-1","text":"HTTP, stdio MCP, typed client, and REPL expose matching option defaults and receipt fields.","isSatisfied":true,"evidence":"2026-07-10 focused gates: Support.Mcp transcript unit 60/0/0, transcript integration\u002BMcpTransport 22/0/0, Repl.Core transcript 4/0/0, Client ingest transcript 2/0/0, clean plugin Pester 47/0/0. Tests: Client ingest tests; Repl.Core transcript tests; TranscriptMcpTool/StdioHost; McpTransport transcript tools."}],"ScopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1","ScopeEndLayerKey":null},{"Id":"TR-MCP-TRANSCRIPT-008","Title":"Provider normalization and native stores","Body":"Support secondary provider normalization for Cline paired JSON, Copilot event streams, OpenCode JSONL exports, and read-only OpenCode SQLite snapshots.","WorkspaceId":"F:\\GitHub\\McpServer","Priority":"high","Status":"completed","Notes":"Core slice added Cline paired JSON, Copilot event stream, and OpenCode JSON/export adapters. OpenCode SQLite snapshot ingestion remains pending. Evidence: TranscriptCorePipelineTests and real fixtures.","AcceptanceCriteria":[{"id":"ac-1","text":"Cline, Copilot, and OpenCode native storage tests verify loss-aware normalization and OpenCode snapshot read-only behavior.","isSatisfied":true,"evidence":"2026-07-10 focused gates: Support.Mcp transcript unit 60/0/0, transcript integration\u002BMcpTransport 22/0/0, Repl.Core transcript 4/0/0, Client ingest transcript 2/0/0, clean plugin Pester 47/0/0. Tests: real fixture normalization; OpenCodeSqliteTranscriptTests no DB/WAL writes and WAL snapshot capture."}],"ScopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1","ScopeEndLayerKey":null},{"Id":"TR-MCP-TRANSCRIPT-009","Title":"Codex transcript ingestion normalizes tool-call, reasoning, and turn_context records","Body":"Codex transcript ingestion SHALL normalize tool-call, reasoning, and turn_context rollout records so known record 