ion_error, not_found, and conflict are retryable false unless SQLITE_BUSY or deadlock.","WorkspaceId":"F:\\GitHub\\McpServer","Priority":"high","Status":"pending","Notes":null,"AcceptanceCriteria":[{"id":"ac-1","text":"One shared classifier produces code, message, retryable, and details. McpToolErrors, the /mcpserver exception filter, the REPL error envelope, and the plugin shim consume it. backend_unavailable is retryable true. persistence_error, validation_error, not_found, and conflict are retryable false unless SQLITE_BUSY or deadlock.","isSatisfied":false,"evidence":null}],"ScopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1","ScopeEndLayerKey":null},{"Id":"TR-MCP-TRIAGEHELP-001","Title":"Agent Help no completed echo and long timeout","Body":"AgentHelpConversationService and GrokCliAgentExecutionStrategy do not mark echo-fallback or progress-only output as completed. UseEchoHelperFallback default false or never sets completed. Plugin long timeout covers workflow.agenthelp.submitTurn.","WorkspaceId":"F:\\GitHub\\McpServer","Priority":"high","Status":"pending","Notes":null,"AcceptanceCriteria":[{"id":"ac-1","text":"AgentHelpConversationService and GrokCliAgentExecutionStrategy do not mark echo-fallback or progress-only output as completed. UseEchoHelperFallback default false or never sets completed. Plugin long timeout covers workflow.agenthelp.submitTurn.","isSatisfied":false,"evidence":null}],"ScopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1","ScopeEndLayerKey":null},{"Id":"TR-MCP-TRIAGEPLUGIN-001","Title":"Sticky root session cache rebind and degraded persist","Body":"plugins/core cache-scope keeps root session-state for UserPromptSubmit. ReplacePluginCache retains or rebinds. Resolve-McpCacheDir uses hook workspace path when env and profile cwd would fail. Get-ReplMethodTimeoutSeconds long list includes workflow.agenthelp.submitTurn. beginTurn degraded path and completeTurn persist identity are implemented in repl-invoke.ps1.","WorkspaceId":"F:\\GitHub\\McpServer","Priority":"high","Status":"pending",